The shim exports functions with the names and signatures of the AMD HIP runtime API.
HIP is Copyright (c) Advanced Micro Devices, Inc., released under the MIT License
(https://github.com/ROCm/clr). No AMD source code or binary is included in this
repository; the shim forwards calls at runtime to the amdhip64.dll installed with the
AMD driver. Tensile/rocBLAS (MIT, Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.) are referenced by the
tools in tensile/ and strumenti/ but not included.

runtime/src/zstd/ contains the decompression part of Zstandard 1.5.7, unmodified,
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates, BSD license (runtime/src/zstd/LICENSE).
It is compiled into the shim to open compressed clang offload bundles (CCOB).
The kpack (HIPK) path calls rocm_kpack.dll from the AMD ROCm wheels at runtime;
that library is not included.
